IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0017.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY CLM0017C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 WS-SIU             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 WS-CLST            PIC X VALUE 'A'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM CHECK-POLICE-RPT
    PERFORM FREQUENT-CLAIMANT
    DISPLAY "WS-SIU=" WS-SIU
    DISPLAY "WS-CLST=" WS-CLST
    STOP RUN.
CHECK-POLICE-RPT.
    IF L-TY = 'A' AND PR-FLG = 'N' AND C-VL > 10000
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SIU
        MOVE 'I' TO WS-CLST
    END-IF.
FREQUENT-CLAIMANT.
    IF P-CC >= 4
        MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SIU
    END-IF.
